itiation_expired", "provider_failure", "unconfirmed_change"], "findings": [{"code": "mechanism_observation", "statement": "The observed Cedar failure was a 410 with connection_state EXPIRED; the initiation age was 950 seconds against a 600-second completion window, and token exchange was not attempted.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_7b13e68f1976", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "pre_provider_failure", "statement": "The failed execution stopped before provider token exchange, so the immediate failure mechanism occurred inside the authentication initiation window check rather than at Airtable.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_7b13e68f1976", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "controlled_comparison", "statement": "In controlled sandbox observations, the original condition reproduced the same 410 EXPIRED result with initiation age 950 and no token exchange, while the corrected condition succeeded with status 200, ACTIVE state, initiation age 120, and token exchange attempted.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_a964fad6c294", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:reproduce:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_a964fad6c294", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:reproduce:1"}]}, {"code": "tenant_impact", "statement": "Impact was concentrated in Cedar: 390 failures out of 636 requests, all 390 business operations blocked, queue depth 114, and p95 latency 1520 ms, while comparison tenant Maple had 0 failures out of 538 requests, queue depth 0, and p95 latency 160 ms.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_65a1711cc8ff", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:metrics:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_65a1711cc8ff", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "verification_control", "statement": "Public toolkit knowledge matches the observed mechanism: an unfinished connection initiation expires after its allowed ten-minute window.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_1c7dfb78223e", "record_id": "airtable-expiry-041:knowledge:0"}]}], "action_codes": ["authentication_initiation_expired_remediation"]}}
